QuestGuidance.Register("en",105,{
[3329]="70052736\n1\tTalk to Mudro on the upper level of Skarháld\tMudro is to the north-east of Gandalf, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Dolek on the upper level of Skarháld\tDolek is to the south-west of Mudro, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n3\tTalk to Ibor on the upper level of Skarháld\tIbor is to the north-west of Dolek, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf inside the chamber that was given to him in the north-east corner of the upper level of Skarháld\tGandalf is in the chamber that was prepared for him in the north-east corner of the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
[3330]="70052738\n1\tTalk to Mudro on the upper level of Skarháld\tMudro is to the north-east of Gandalf, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Dolek on the upper level of Skarháld\tDolek is to the south-west of Mudro, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n3\tTalk to Ibor on the upper level of Skarháld\tIbor is to the north-west of Dolek, on the upper level of Skarháld.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf inside the chamber that was given to him in the north-east corner of the upper level of Skarháld\tGandalf is in the chamber that was prepared for him in the north-east corner of the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
[3331]="70052757\n1\tTalk to Gandalf in his chamber at Skarháld and learn of his discoveries from the Black Book\tGandalf is in the chamber of Skarháld given to him by Durin, waiting to discuss with you the contents of the Black Book of Mordor.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf in his chamber at Skarháld\tGandalf is in the chamber of Skarháld given to him by Durin, waiting to discuss with you the contents of the Black Book of Mordor.\n",
[3332]="7006A888\n1\tDefeat rats in Ilmabiri (total: 6)\030Defeat crocodiles in Ilmabiri (total: 3)\tBirûk suggested that you defeat rats and crocodiles within Ilmabiri.\n2\tFind the metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri\tBirûk told you to find a metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri.\n3\tPlace the crusty bread on the metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri\tThe empty metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri waits for the bread Birûk gave to you.\n4\tWait and see if you are contacted by one of the Terâsi\tBirûk told you that leaving food here should summon one of the Terâsi, the forgotten ones of Umbar-môkh. Now you must wait and see if he was right.\n5\tTalk to the girl in the darkness beyond the grate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri\tYou hear a girl's voice from the darkness beyond the grate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri.\n6\tSteal an unattended meal from the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward\tThe Terâsi girl you encountered in Ilmabiri asked you to retrieve a meal of higher quality from the Upper Ward, as well as a bottle of fancy wine, or she will tell you nothing. The tables at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh may have what you need.\n7\tSteal an unattended bottle of wine from the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward\tThe Terâsi girl you encountered in Ilmabiri asked you to retrieve a meal of higher quality from the Upper Ward, as well as a bottle of fancy wine, or she will tell you nothing. The tables at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward may have what you need.\n8\tHave you been seen?\t\n9\tPlace the meal and wine on the metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri\tThe empty metal plate in the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri waits for the meal and wine you \"retrieved\" from the Upper Ward.\n10\tWait for the Terâsi girl Tephísa to return\tYou must wait once again for the Terâsi girl Tephísa to return.\n11\tTalk to Tephísa, the Terâsi girl in the darkness at the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri\tTephísa, the Terâsi girl, has returned to the south-eastern corner of Ilmabiri.\n",
[3333]="7006A88A\n1\tTalk to Birûk at Itekh-kên in Khabârkhad\tBirûk waits for you at Itekh-kên in Khabârkhad, and may be able to guide your search of Kamrabezûr for Tatháta.\n2\tFind Kên Taghlim in north-western Kamrabezûr\tBirûk suggested that you go to Kên Taghlim in the north-western reaches of Kamrabezûr, but that you should steer clear of the great beasts rumoured to have escaped from the arena.\n3\tTalk to Corudan at Kên Taghlim\tCorudan stands at Kên Taghlim in north-western Kamrabezûr.\n4\tDefeat All-Seeing Eye cultists in Kamrabezûr (total: 6)\030Defeat sand-sifters in Kamrabezûr (total: 6)\030Search the centre of the cultist camp of Jâx Ugikh for Tatháta\030Search the centre of Ghâr Mejet for Tatháta\030Search the centre of Harkhaphâr for Tatháta\tCorudan and Sigileth have suggested a number of places for you to search throughout Kamrabezûr, and encouraged you to defeat any foes that stand in the way of your investigation.\n5\tTalk to Corudan at Kên Taghlim in north-western Kamrabezûr\tCorudan stands at Kên Taghlim in north-western Kamrabezûr.\n6\tTalk to Sigileth at Kên Taghlim and go with her in search of Tatháta\tSigileth stands at Kên Taghlim in north-western Kamrabezûr, prepared to go with you in search of Tatháta's hiding-place.\n7\tTalk to Corudan by the grave\tCorudan stands beside Galatâni's grave outside the city.\n",
[3334]="70052758\n1\tTalk to the Zhélruka messenger in Gandalf's chamber at Skarháld\tA dwarf has come to Gandalf's chamber in Skarháld, and he has a message for you.\n2\tSearch along the road to the Glimmerdeep to find the message's sender\tSomeone wants to meet you on the road to the Glimmerdeep, and you should find out who it is.\n3\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind outside Skarháld.\tVútro the West-wind is on the road leading to the Glimmerdeep.\n4\tFind frost-drake tracks to the south along the road\tVútro the West-wind saw frost-drake tracks to the south, and he thinks following them will lead you to the wounded Karazgar.\n5\tFind frost-drake tracks further south along the road\tVútro the West-wind saw frost-drake tracks to the south, and he thinks following them will lead you to the wounded Karazgar.\n6\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind by the hidden path among the rocks\tYou followed frost-drake tracks to a partially-hidden path that winds its way up the mountains. Vútro the West-wind stands at the start of the path, eager to speak with you.\n7\tClimb the steep hidden path you discovered\tBy following frost-drake tracks in the Ered Mithrin, you found a hidden path climbing into the mountains. Did drakes of the Frost-horde come this way in search of Karazgar?\n8\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind inside the cave\tVútro the West-wind is inside the shadowy cave you discovered high among the rocks in the Ered Mithrin.\n",
[3335]="70052759\n1\tSearch the lair for some sign of Karazgar\tVútro the West-wind has asked you to search Karazgar's lair for some sign of the Weeping Warrior.\n2\tVútro the West-wind has asked you to search Karazgar's lair for some sign of the Weeping Warrior.\t\n3\tSearch the lair for some sign of Karazgar\tVútro the West-wind has asked you to search Karazgar's lair for some sign of the Weeping Warrior.\n4\tSearch the lair for some sign of Karazgar\tVútro the West-wind has asked you to search Karazgar's lair for some sign of the Weeping Warrior.\n5\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind in Karazgar's lair\tVútro the West-wind has entered the large chamber at the rear of Karazgar's lair.\n",
[3336]="7006A88B\n1\tLeave Galatâni's dagger on the grave\tYou should leave Galatâni's dagger on the grave.\n2\tTalk to Sigileth by the grave\tSigileth stands by the grave, deep in thought.\n3\tReturn to Hármelak in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tHármelak waits in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja to hear what you have learned about Tatháta from your time seeking her in Umbar-môkh.\n4\tTalk to Hármelak in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tHármelak waits in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja to hear what you have learned about Tatháta.\n",
[3337]="7005275A\n1\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind outside the cave mouth north-west of Skarháld\tVútro the West-wind has called for a halt north-west of Skarháld, near a cave entrance.\n2\tExplore the tunnel with Vútro the West-wind\tVútro the West-wind has called for a halt north-west of Skarháld, near a cave entrance.\n3\tTalk to Gandalf on the upper level of Skarháld\tGandalf stands on the upper level of Skarháld following his confrontation with Karazgar.\n",
[3338]="7006A88C\n1\tTalk to Belondor in Dâr Laja\030Talk to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja\030Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja\tHármelak suggested that you speak with the other leaders of the Kindred of the Coins in the main hall of Dâr Laja about the dangers their people will face in the days ahead.\n2\tTalk to Jajax in Dâr Laja\tJajax has some words for you in the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja.\n3\tTalk to Hármelak in Dâr Laja\tHármelak is in the main hall of Dâr Laja, waiting to speak with you again.\n4\tTalk to Jaith outside Dâr Laja\tThe guardsman Jaith stands outside the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja. Hármelak has asked that you warn him to keep watch in case Tatháta assaults the entrance in search of you or the leaders of the Kindred.\n",
[3339]="70017EB5\n1\tTalk to Hundi\tHundi is at Echad Dúnann, not far to the west of Ráthwald, in Eregion. Ráthwald has asked you to speak to his friend Hundi, who aided in the recovery of a cache of weapons that may prove useful.\n",
[3340]="70017EB6\n1\tTalk to Hundi\tHundi is at Echad Dúnann, not far to the west of Ráthwald, in Eregion. Ráthwald has asked you to speak to his friend Hundi, who aided in the recovery of a cache of weapons that may prove useful.\n",
