[3351]="7001B5CC\n1\tCollect a rare Sereglos flower\030Collect unmarked Saewathel venom-sac\tThe Sereglos flower grows for a short span of time on untended barrows in Mirkwood. Unmarked venom sacs from Saewathel or Blackvenom spiders, of the breeds related to the spider that poisoned Mazog and Issuriel may be found throughout the Scuttledells, north of Ost Galadh. Time is short: if the errand of the Hidden Guard is to succeed, Issuriel demands that you gather the components of an antidote to cure Mazog of the gwigael poison.\n2\tBring the components for the antidote to Issuriel in Ost Galadh\tIssuriel is within the makeshift camp in the storage room Gadorgar, inside Ost Galadh, south of the Scuttledells. You have found the rare ingredients for the antidote Issuriel mentioned and should return to her with them at once.\n3\tFind Barvessain and give her the components for the antidote\tBarvessain is somewhere in Ost Galadh, in Emyn Lûm, south of the Scuttledells. Issuriel has weakly asked you to find Barvessain, somewhere in Ost Galadh, and to get her to brew the antidote for the gwigael poison from the components you collected.\n4\tMazog and Issuriel are both within Gadorgar, the makeshift storage room in Ost Galadh. You now have a single dose of Laidhris antidote and must give it to one of the victims of the Gwigael poison.\t\n5\tTalk to Achardor at Ost Galadh\tAchardor is in Gadorgar, the makeshift storage room in Ost Galadh. You have given the antidote to Mazog, and Achardor is not pleased.\n6\tTalk to Gruingalas at Ost Galadh\tGruingalas is outside the door to Gadorgar, in Ost Galadh. Archardor wants no one coming into Gadorgar anymore, in order for Issuriel to rest. He also wants the scouts recalled in preparation for the exchange of Mazog and has asked you to tell Gruingalas of these requests.\n",
[3352]="70025393\n1\tExamine Ergothorn's body for clues to his demise\tErgothorn's body is in the Hall of Making, to the north-east of Halbarad. Halbarad has asked you to examine Ergothorn's body to see if you can learn anything more of his fate.\n2\tBring the letter to Halbarad in Lhanuch\tHalbarad is among the huts on the western side of Lhanuch. You have read Ergothorn's last letter and should return now to Halbarad to tell him what it said.\n3\tTalk to Radanir in the grove of trees east of Lhanuch\tRadanir is at the camp-site of the Grey Company in the grove of trees east of Lhanuch. Halbarad has directed you to speak with Radanir to tell him to investigate Ergothorn's claim that the Oath-breakers who came to the Lich Bluffs might be compelled to fulfil their oath.\n",
[3353]="7002099D\n1\tTalk to Elrond in Rivendell\tMaster Elrond is in the library of his house, in Rivendell. You have brought word of the Grey Company's need to the Rangers spoken of by Master Elrond and should return now to him.\n",
[3354]="700147EF\n1\tTalk to Haldir and arrange an audience with the Lady Galadriel\tHaldir is atop a flet outside Lothlórien, south of the river Nimrodel. Lenglammel has told you to speak with Haldir about arranging an audience with the Lady Galadriel.\n2\tTalk to Haldir\tHaldir is at his camp outside Lothlórien. Galadriel has seen many things about your future in her Mirror, but you cannot make sense of the confused images.\n",
[3355]="70021E8D\n1\tFind Echad Dagoras in Fordirith\tLothrandir will be waiting for you at Echad Dagoras, the next stop on the Grey Company's journey south into Fordirith, in northern Enedwaith. It is time to ride south into Enedwaith. The Grey Company will stop for rest at Echad Dagoras, in Fordirith.\n2\tTalk to Lothrandir at Echad Dagoras\tLothrandir is at Echad Dagoras, the camp of the Grey Company in Fordirith, the northern reaches of Enedwaith. The Grey Company has passed into Enedwaith, and you should speak now to Lothrandir to learn the lay of the land.\n3\tTalk to Wadu at Echad Dagoras\tWadu of the Uch-lûth has come to Echad Dagoras in Fordirith. Lothrandir has asked you to speak with Wadu of the Uch-lûth.\n",
[3356]="7005A721\n1\tTalk to Prince Ingór\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.\n2\tHang the head of Svalnath in Vérnozal\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. You should hang the head of Svalnath in Vérnozal.\n3\tTalk to Prince Ingór\tVérnozal can be found in Máttugard, by the Steepset. Prince Ingór wishes to talk to you.\n",
[3357]="70018F12\n1\tTalk to Haldir\tHaldir is in a flet in a great tree on the banks of the Nimrodel, outside Lórien. You have been told that Celeborn desires to speak with you about recent events in Moria, and should speak to Haldir about arranging a meeting with the Lord of Lórien.\n2\tTalk to Haldir and travel to your audience with Celeborn\tHaldir is on Talan Haldir, a flet in a great tree along the banks of the Nimrodel, just outside Lórien. Haldir is waiting to hear when you are ready to speak with Celeborn.\n3\tTalk to Haldir\tHaldir is on Talan Haldir, a flet in a great tree along the banks of the Nimrodel, just outside Lórien. Haldir is waiting to speak with you now that you have had your audience with Celeborn.\n",
[3358]="700143DF\n1\tTalk to Bósi and experience 'Session: We Cannot Get Out' or read the shortened account instead\tBósi is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads at the southern entrance of Durin's Way, north of the Western Levels. Bósi is willing to tell you the story of the end of Balin's expedition, a tale he learned from the Book of Mazarbul.\n2\tTalk to Bósi\tBósi is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads at the southern entrance of Durin's Way, north of the Great Delving. You have listened to the sad fate of Balin's expedition, and should talk now to Bósi.\n",
[3359]="700272BE\n1\tScout Rhuvel-cadlus\tThere might be some indication of who is pressing the Ox-clan into service within Rhuvel-cadlus, in the valley below Cuthric's post. Cuthric asked you to search for some sign of who is behind the muster of the Ox-clan.\n2\tTalk to Cuthric\tCuthric is hiding on the ridge above Rhuvel-cadlus. You should return to Cuthric with news of your discovery.\n",
[3360]="70027328\n1\tDefeat creatures in Tâl Methedras while bearing the Charm of the Huntsman (total: 10)\tWild creatures can be found throughout Tâl Methedras. Cungen has asked you to defeat wild creatures throughout Tâl Methedras while bearing the charm of the Wild Huntsman, believing it will become even stronger with every victory.\n2\tReturn the Charm of the Huntsman to Cungen\tCungen is on the uppermost level of Tûr Morva. You have defeated many creatures while bearing the Charm of the Huntsman and should return the charm to Cungen.\n",
})
